message: "If you use or discuss this public dev-calibration package, please cite it as below and do not describe it as a final hidden-holdout benchmark or leaderboard."
title: "Throughline: public dev-preview / dev-calibration package"
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "pr0xyh0rse - Hannah Bird"
year: 2026
date-released: "2026-06-26"
license: "CC-BY-4.0"
abstract: >-
  Throughline is a public dev-preview / dev-calibration package for testing
  whether story-generation models preserve live narrative state while writing
  or revising. The package includes public/dev-visible prompts, rubrics,
  manifests, scoring templates, source notes, runner scaffolding, and final-eval
  lane policy. It is not a final hidden-holdout evaluation, leaderboard, or
  release-grade model-ranking artifact.
keywords:
  - language-model-evaluation
  - narrative-generation
  - benchmark-calibration
  - creative-writing-evaluation
  - dev-calibration
